OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,FThe government has announced a call
OL,7,Ffor evidence to crack down on 'fake'
OL,8,Fnurses.
OL,10,FMinisters said people who misuse the
OL,11,Ftitle 'nurse' can put patients at
OL,12,Frisk, and are seeking views on the
OL,13,Flist of professions allowed to use the
OL,14,Ftitle.
OL,16,FEarlier this year officials announced
OL,17,Fplans to make it a criminal offence
OL,18,Ffor people who are not qualified as a
OL,19,Fnurse to use the term.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
