OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,FIt comes after a coroner criticised
OL,7,Fthe "misleading" use of the title
OL,8,F"maternity nurse", following the death
OL,9,Fof four-month-old Madison Bruce Smith,
OL,10,Fgrandson of football manager Steve
OL,11,FBruce.
OL,13,FMadison was found unresponsive by his
OL,14,Ffather, Matt Smith in October 2024.
OL,16,FMr Smith, ex-Leeds United and Fulham
OL,17,Fstriker, and his wife had hired a
OL,18,Fmaternity nurse because Madison
OL,19,Fstruggled to sleep.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,FThe nurse, whose only medical
OL,7,Fqualification was first aid, suggested
OL,8,Fhe should be positioned on his front
OL,9,Fto sleep, despite advice that babies
OL,10,Fshould always be placed on their backs.
OL,12,FAlison Mutch, senior coroner for
OL,13,FManchester South, wrote in her
OL,14,Fprevention of future deaths report:
OL,15,F"Any person can describe themselves as
OL,16,Fa maternity nurse or a sleep nurse or
OL,17,Fa post-natal nurse.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,F"No qualifications are required and
OL,7,Fthere is no regulation of persons
OL,8,Fholding themselves out as maternity
OL,9,Fnurses or the agencies that offer
OL,10,Ftraining courses or their services.
OL,12,F"In this case, the maternity nurse and
OL,13,Fthe owner of the agency had no medical
OL,14,Fqualifications other than a basic
OL,15,Ffirst aid qualification.
OL,17,F"The use of the word nurse gave the
OL,18,Fimpression of a level of knowledge and
OL,19,Fskills that were not present."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU{D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,FHealth minister Baroness Gillian
OL,7,FMerron said patients should never have
OL,8,Fto question whether a nurse is
OL,9,Fproperly qualified.
OL,11,FShe said: "The title carries huge
OL,12,Ftrust, and anyone misusing it risks
OL,13,Fundermining not just public
OL,14,Fconfidence, but patient safety too.
OL,16,F"That is why we are asking for views
OL,17,Fon how best to protect the title, stop
OL,18,Fmisuse and make sure patients know
OL,19,Fthey are in safe hands."
OL,26,@sD@KOUxD@AOU{D@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
