OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,FThe government's call for evidence
OL,7,Fwill close at the end of September.
OL,9,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,10,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,11,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,12,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,14,FProfessor Lynn Woolsey, chief nursing
OL,15,Fofficer at the Royal College of
OL,16,FNursing, described the news as a
OL,17,F"significant win and step towards
OL,18,Fprotecting the title of nurse."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785392286
OL,3,CGovernment calls for evidence to crack
OL,4,Cdown on 'fake' nurses
OL,6,F"Nursing is a highly skilled, safety-
OL,7,Fcritical profession and it is
OL,8,Fessential to patient safety that our
OL,9,Ftitle is protected.
OL,11,F"Patients and their families deserve
OL,12,Fto trust that when they are told they
OL,13,Fare being treated by a nurse, it is a
OL,14,Fregistered nurse providing their care.
OL,16,F"They need to be able to trust that
OL,17,Fknowledge, professionalism and
OL,18,Fclinical expertise that comes with our
OL,19,Fprofession," she added.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU{D@LO]
